'''Thunderblood Dagger''' is a version of [[Nord Dagger]] upgraded with a [[Thunderblood Essence]]. It gains extra [[slash]], [[pierce]] and [[Lightning|lightning damage]], a 25% chance per hit to trigger [[Chain lightning]] and a 0.2% damage increase for every 1 point of [[health]] the player is missing.

* The primary attack is a fast 3-slash combo with 2x damage on the last swing.
* Its secondary attack is a leaping stab with 3x damage.
* It deals 6x damage against [[Creature senses|unalerted]] enemies.

An upgraded Nord Dagger will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is crafted into Thunderblood Dagger.

